                    <h2 class="sub">                    Bidirectional Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <ul><li>Ultra-light vibration pickup</li><li>Condenser transducer in sealed enclosure</li><li>Cable with lockable miniature XLR connector</li></ul><p>Weighing only 18 grams (0.6 oz.), this ultra-light condenser pickup is ideal for acoustic guitar, mandolin, violin, and most other stringed instruments. The C&nbsp;411 will give a clear and uncolored sound without changing the balance of the instrument. Attaching the C&nbsp;411 on or near the bridge or anywhere else on the instrument is easy with the included non-marring, reusable, solventfree adhesive compound.</p><p>Two versions of the <b>C411</b> are available:</p><ul><li><b>C411L</b>: with mini XLR connector for use with B29L battery operated power supply, MPAIIIL external phantom power adapter, or AKG WMS bodypack transmitters.</li><li><b>C411PP</b>: with an XLR male connector (MSRP $169)</li></ul><p><p>The <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/AKG-Acoustics/C-411">AKG Acoustics C 411</a> is also known as: C411, C 411.</p>
